WEBVTT

00:08:28.855 --> 00:08:30.093
And in this case,

00:08:30.117 --> 00:08:33.316
the immune cells in the liver
are less likely to eat

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:35.289
the biological nanoparticles.

00:08:35.691 --> 00:08:38.619
So we're using
a Trojan-horse-based concept

00:08:38.643 --> 00:08:40.230
to fool the liver.

00:08:40.921 --> 00:08:43.278
And here we see
the biological nanoparticles

00:08:43.302 --> 00:08:44.881
circulating in the blood.

00:08:44.905 --> 00:08:47.301
They don't get recognized by the liver,

00:08:47.325 --> 00:08:49.489
and they end up in the tumor.

00:08:50.413 --> 00:08:51.849
And in the future,

00:08:51.873 --> 00:08:55.396
we want to exploit
nature's own nanoparticles

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:57.493
for cancer drug delivery,

00:08:58.387 --> 00:09:01.323
to reduce side effects and save lives